            "description": "## Update Produk\n\nMemperbarui data produk yang sudah ada berdasarkan ID produk.\n\n### Endpoint\n\n`PUT /api/products/:id`\n\n### Path Variables\n\n| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | number | Yes | ID produk |\n\n### Request Body\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `description` | string | No | Deskripsi baru untuk produk |\n\n### Response\n\n**200 OK** — Produk berhasil diperbarui.\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"title\": \"Awesome T-Shirt\",\n    \"price\": 99.99,\n    \"description\": \"Super Awesome T-Shirt\",\n    \"category\": \"Clothes\",\n    \"images\": [\"https://placeimg.com/640/480/any\"],\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-28 05:31:30\",\n    \"createdBy\": \"admin\",\n    \"createdById\": 1,\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-28 05:38:35\",\n    \"updatedBy\": \"admin\",\n    \"updatedById\": 1\n  }\n}\n\n ```"
